### Liveness
GET http://localhost:8080/health/live

### Readiness
GET http://localhost:8080/health/ready

### Create a heartbeat
POST http://localhost:8080/api/heartbeats
Content-Type: application/json

{"service":"billing-worker","status":"ok","note":"processing queue"}

### Query tracked services
GET http://localhost:8080/api/services?filter=online

### Simple metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics
